# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Model checkpoints
#
# 91 .pt files totalling 29.1 GB - 56 of them individually exceed
# GitHub's 100 MB hard limit. They are re-derivable by running the
# training scripts, so they are deliberately not tracked. Everything
# else in this repo is ~19 MB.
#
# If you ever need them versioned, use Git LFS with a paid data pack
# (the free tier is 1 GB) or an external artifact store - do not try
# to commit them directly.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------
*.pt
*.pth
*.ckpt
*.h5
*.safetensors

# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Smoke-test output
#
# Written by run_baselines_canonical.py --smoke: 200 training rows,
# 1 epoch, results meaningless. This folder already has one bad
# experience with fake results sitting at real-looking paths, so
# smoke output never gets committed.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------
results_SMOKE_DO_NOT_CITE/

# Claude Code session scaffolding (contains working notes, not project content)
.claude-handoff/
.claude/

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
*.egg-info/

# Logs and scratch
*.log
.wtest

# Windows / OneDrive / Office artefacts
desktop.ini
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
~$*
*.tmp
